This software is the end-to-end test suite for the BSV Layered Multicast
delivery fabric. It compiles the fabric's components from pinned source
checkouts, runs them as containers on an IPv6 multicast bridge, and asserts
the delivery, filtering, fragmentation, repair, coalescing, manifest and
BEEF object plane contracts that the fabric's BRC specifications define.
The tpnil directory runs selected scenarios under the component
qualification protocol of the Transaction Processing Network
Interoperability Laboratory, and builds the regtest transaction fixtures
of its joined-configuration qualifications.

